---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Free Writing Tools: Word Count, Readability, Stock Phrases | CleanDraft" description="Check a draft's word count, reading ease, sentence length and stock phrases. Free, no signup, and it runs on your device.">
  <article class="page">
    <h1>Free writing tools</h1>
    <p class="lede">Editors that run on your device. Nothing to install, and no account.</p>
    <ul class="card-list">
      <li><a href="/">Text humanizer</a><p>Removes stock AI phrasing and shows every edit.</p></li>
      <li><a href="/ai-email-editor">Email editor</a><p>Clean up an AI-drafted email before you send it.</p></li>
      <li><a href="/ai-blog-post-editor">Blog post editor</a><p>Edit long drafts while keeping headings and lists in place.</p></li>
      <li><a href="/linkedin-post-editor">LinkedIn post editor</a><p>Remove the buzzwords that make posts sound alike.</p></li>
    </ul>
    <h2 id="checker">Text checker</h2>
    <p>Paste a draft to see its word count, reading ease and longest sentence, plus any stock phrases from our lexicon. This is editing help based on our own word lists. It isn't an AI detector, and it can't tell you who wrote a text.</p>
    <label for="ck-input"><strong>Your text</strong></label>
    <textarea id="ck-input" placeholder="Paste your draft here."></textarea>
    <div class="stats" aria-live="polite">
      <div><strong id="ck-words">0</strong>Words</div>
      <div><strong id="ck-sentences">0</strong>Sentences</div>
      <div><strong id="ck-avg">0</strong>Words per sentence</div>
      <div><strong id="ck-long">0</strong>Longest sentence</div>
      <div><strong id="ck-read">n/a</strong>Reading ease (estimate)</div>
      <div><strong id="ck-hits">0</strong>Stock phrases</div>
    </div>
    <p class="hint">Reading ease is the Flesch score estimated from syllable counts: higher is easier, and 60 to 70 suits most general readers.</p>
    <h3>Stock phrases found</h3>
    <ul id="ck-list"><li>None yet.</li></ul>
  </article>
  <script>
    import '../scripts/checker.js';
  </script>
</Base>
